WEBVTT

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.370
When did you alter the wall?

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:21.830
I made preparations a while back, so we could escape at any time.

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:26.290
You were to be my bodyguard. Aren't you devoted to your job?!

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:28.790
We don't have time for your sarcasm.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:30.500
I know...

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:35.130
I am prepared to endure any hardship until I see Mother.

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:39.220
There aren't any roads around here. Watch your step.

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.270
This is nothing. I-

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:43.390
I just said it, too...

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:46.150
Are you all right, Kanna-sama?!

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:49.110
Do I look all right to you?!

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:51.730
I cannot tell. It is too dark.

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:54.280
I surely hope your omote-gi has not been sullied.

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:56.610
You worry more about the clothes than your master?!

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:59.450
Both of you, pull up the bottoms of your clothes.

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:04.000
Oh, my! Both of us at the same time. Ryuuya-sama, you are so lewd.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.420
You're no different than an animal.

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:08.880
Do you even understand what you're saying?!

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:12.550
I'm telling you to roll up your clothes so it's easier to move around.

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:14.340
Our pursuers should be close by.

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.670
Ryuuya-sama...

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:28.850
We watched the fading contrails go by.

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:32.570
I ran away because it was too bright.

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:42.790
I let go of your hands because it hurt.

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:50.130
The place I can't reach is still far away.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:57.090
I gaze at it with a wish locked away inside.

00:01:57.090 --> 00:02:05.430
The children walk on the summer railway tracks,

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:12.110
with hope that will take flight in my hands.

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:19.990
I chased and chased the fading contrails.

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:29.290
Nothing changed since the day we went past that hill.

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:35.840
I hope we can be our honest selves forever,

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:49.640
and definitely protect this Poseidon-like strength.

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:55.400
Stay close to me.

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.170
Run!

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.530
You can move now.

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:46.200
This is quite troublesome...

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.410
You kept quiet very well.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:50.580
Don't underestimate me!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:53.210
I am no coward.

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:55.460
Hurry up, else I'll leave you behind.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:57.710
That's the direction we came from.

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:05.180
Looks like they sent a lot of people after us.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:07.720
Uraha, you brought a change of clothes for Kanna, right?

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:14.560
You two just sit down and take it easy.

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:15.940
Don't move from here.

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:16.770
Ryuuya-sama!

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:17.900
Don't worry.

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:25.990
Over there! It's a woman!

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:27.370
She's faster than expected!

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:29.830
Don't lose sight of her! Hurry!

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:42.800
The woman fell into the mountain stream!

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.130
It looks like she fell into the stream!

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:46.010
I heard it directly below.

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:48.010
Look! A piece of cloth!

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:50.470
Gather the troops! Hurry!

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:53.600
Search downstream!

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:02.780
Throw down your sword.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:08.030
Answer my questions truthfully...

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:11.120
...and I'll spare your life.

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.700
You're from Azuma, aren't you?

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:15.330
Why are you after Kannabi no Mikoto?

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:16.460
I don't know!

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.580
We've just been ordered to do so!

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.790
What do you plan to do with Kannabi no Mikoto?

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:21.920
Whose orders are you acting on?

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.050
I don't know!

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:25.300
Our captain just told us to do it!

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:26.760
I see.

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:31.930
Stop!

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:41.520
Were you going to kill him?

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:44.150
Our lives would have been in danger if I didn't.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:46.110
Have you no shame, you fool?!

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:51.830
You just told him you would spare his life.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:54.080
Do you lie as if it were nothing?

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.500
Do you break your vows as if it were nothing?

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:59.080
If the time and situation call for it...

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:03.550
So you are saying that you will break your vow to me if the time and situation call for it...

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:09.180
Do you kill people as if it were nothing?

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:12.390
Kanna-sama...

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:15.390
I do not want to be protected by one such as yourself!

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:20.020
I order you...

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:24.520
As long as I am your master, I forbid you to commit murder.

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:25.940
Keep that in mind.

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:31.110
Understood.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.530
Very well.

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:40.960
Do you really think we can get out of here without killing a single person?

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:43.540
I believe it shall be effortless for you.

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:46.250
Easy for you to say.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:53.100
You can relax now. I don't see any sign of pursuit.

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:55.680
That's a relief...

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:58.890
Uraha, can you go get some water?

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:00.600
There should be a stream at the bottom.

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:02.650
Certainly.

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:07.280
Kanna, are you all right?

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:10.450
Don't talk to me.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:11.700
You're making my headache worse.

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:14.120
Looks like the heat got to you. Here.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:16.830
What are you doing!?

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:19.410
It's to cool you down.

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:23.080
Just tell me before you do it...

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.710
Okay, I'm going to pour water on you.

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:29.340
I was asking you to be more gentle when you do it!

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:31.170
Stop being so finicky!

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:34.800
You insolent fool!

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:39.850
Oh, my. Kanna-sama is all better now!

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:43.020
See? Children recover so quickly.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:44.810
I am not better!

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:47.690
I'm angry!

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:53.910
But this is bad. The height of summer is just beginning.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:57.910
The heat will get to her quickly in those clothes.

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:01.830
Do not worry. I have already taken proper countermeasures.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:05.330
Now, now, Kanna-sama. Right this way.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.880
I am fine the way I am.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:12.590
Now, now, if you intend to be so naughty, then...

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:20.390
Oh, my! You're drenched in sweat!

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:22.890
Hey! Don't fondle me in strange places!

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:25.230
I knew it! You're wet all the way inside, too!

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:27.900
Stop! It tickles!

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:31.780
I said stop!

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:36.280
What happened?!

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:39.780
That monkey stole Kanna-sama's kimono!

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:42.200
Give it back, insolent fool!

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:43.960
Step aside.

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:48.540
That was marvellous, Ryuuya-sama.

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.800
Yes. I expect nothing less from my loyal subject.

00:08:56.590 --> 00:08:58.140
H-Hey! Stop it!

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:00.100
I will not!

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:04.940
Intruding while your master is changing is the epitome of disloyalty!

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:08.020
You just called me your loyal subject!

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:10.400
Don't give me such an unreasonable retort!

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.940
Which of us is being unreasonable here?!

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:15.450
We are done.

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:20.080
Where did you get this kimono?

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:24.290
I "borrowed" them while they were drying by the riverside.

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:27.040
I left proper compensation, of course.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:28.830
You look pretty nice in them, Kanna.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:31.170
R-Really?

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:32.750
You have strange tastes...

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.840
No matter how I look at you, you look like any other village girl.

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:38.180
A bit too cute for one, actually.

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:40.550
Maybe a bit too bony.

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:42.760
That wasn't necessary!

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:56.860
It doesn't seem like you're getting better at all.

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:59.990
The beginning is the most important part of the learning process.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:04.240
As long as one has a firm foundation, one will improve very quickly.

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:08.750
You want me to practise with these?

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:12.710
One is supposed to juggle with stones!

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:15.840
It will hurt if I get hit by accident.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:18.880
With danger comes desperation.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.800
Uhh, it's not supposed to be a dangerous game...

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:23.100
Now is the time, Kanna-sama!

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:25.680
And... I'm being ignored...

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:35.110
Kanna-sama!!!

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:37.360
Are you all right, Kanna?!

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:38.900
Kanna-sama!

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:48.460
She is sleeping quite soundly.

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:52.670
You should always exercise if you want to get a good night's sleep.

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:56.420
She's been cramped up in that shrine all this time.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:58.920
Yes, she has...

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:00.800
You should get some rest, too.

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.220
We still have to walk through the mountain path tomorrow.

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:05.260
Are you not tired yourself?

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:07.890
I'm fine. I'm used to it.

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:09.730
To war?

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:10.890
Yeah.

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:19.190
You should get some rest.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:21.950
I shall keep watch.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:28.910
All right, I'll leave it to you.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:09.490
I got a good one for you!

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:16.670
This is quite a large market.

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:18.210
What is a market?

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:20.920
It is a place where goods are exchanged.

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.510
Don't make too much of a commotion.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.550
There are people after us.

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:26.720
I know.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:28.760
I am not that foolish.

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:31.730
Uraha! What are these?!

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:36.190
They are called Ubai. They are used to treat illnesses of the abdomen.

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:39.150
Oh, that extremely sour thing.

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:41.360
They have rice cakes!

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:48.030
I remember when you ate too many and had one stuck in your throat.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:51.750
I couldn't help myself because they were too delicious.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:53.410
What's this?

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:55.870
You mean the white sake?

00:12:55.870 --> 00:13:01.670
I remember when you drank it to excess and went on a rampage, and...

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:04.880
You don't have to talk about stupid things every single time!

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:08.260
Hey, did you already forget that I told you not to cause a commotion?

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:10.220
It should be fine.

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:14.810
A little commotion should not draw attention at such a bustling market.

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:19.190
Besides, who could distinguish me from the others in this crowd?

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:22.730
I'm bony, and I only look like a village girl.

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:24.780
You hold grudges over the stupidest things.

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:27.910
All right! I'm sorry!

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:30.120
You're cute. You're magnificently sweet.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:34.000
You're so charming that you stand out in a crowd, so please be more quiet.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:38.750
As always, your praises lack sincerity.

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:40.250
Hey!

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.340
You there.

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:45.170
What is this striped ball?

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:46.260
It's a gourd.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:50.930
But gourds should be softer and juicer.

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:53.260
There's no way you could eat it with it being this hard.

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:55.890
You a princess from somewhere?

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:59.060
Yes, the palace is about ten days away by foot in the mounta-

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:03.860
This girl has been giving me a lot of trouble since she's slightly retarded.

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:06.860
That's too bad.

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:12.870
Who are you calling retarded?!

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:15.160
You... Who else?

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:17.000
Uraha, you should say something too.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:19.120
She's gone...

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:20.500
Uraha!

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:23.040
Where are you, Uraha?

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:28.380
Ow! Don't bite!

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:31.850
That is because you do nothing but commit outrages!

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:35.850
I ended up taking half the day babysitting Kanna.

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:38.560
Where did Uraha go?

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:44.270
I've never seen an ugly bird such as yourself.

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:48.650
It is only unreasonable that you go unsold because of that fidgety chirping of yours.

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:53.530
Cuckoos and scops owls make funnier hoots.

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:05.800
A lowly bird dares to mock me! How insolent!

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:11.590
I'll rip out those ridiculous tail feathers of yours!

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:25.860
Please stop!

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:28.650
That's my most prized longtail!

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:32.820
What are we going to look at next?!

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:35.870
We have to look for Uraha first.

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:37.370
Oh great samurai, sir.

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:43.500
Please have pity on my poor self, sir.

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:49.170
Three days ago, I was chased out of my village and wandered here with nothing but these clothes on my back.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:50.010
Was there a war?

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:52.130
I don't know.

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:54.550
There was a band of men in rough warrior attire.

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:59.470
They ordered me to leave, and took my home as well as my fields.

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:01.810
That is very unfortunate.

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:09.280
Is the lady beside you of noble birth?

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:12.280
You can tell?

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:17.620
No, I am not.

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:24.540
I am nothing but a sweet innocent little village girl. A little bony, though.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:26.250
You're still mad about that?

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:28.750
Don't just stand there.

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.010
Give something to him.

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:34.260
What am I supposed to give him?

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:38.470
This isn't much, but it should help a little.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.810
Thank you so much.

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:42.930
I will never forget this.

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:45.270
Take care.

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:52.940
We did something good.

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:54.780
Not necessarily.

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:56.070
What do you mean?

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:58.370
He could have been a fraud.

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:02.450
Even I'd lie and kiss ass if I were desperate.

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:06.330
Believing a begger's life story will only make a fool out of you.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:09.420
You are such a fool.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:13.130
Even you could see how thin and weak he looked.

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:16.970
Oh, I see.

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:24.020
I'm hungry.

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:26.020
The very moment you impress me, I get this.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:29.230
Well, Kanna-sama is still growing.

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:35.030
If you're going to grow, you might as well grow some plump breasts instead of a bigger ass.

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:36.400
Quiet, you!

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:38.910
You don't look too happy. What's wrong, Uraha?

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.910
You're not surprised at all...

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:45.870
Whoa! When did you come back, Uraha?! I didn't notice you at all!

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:49.040
You always appear out of nowhere.

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:53.500
Thank you for such obviously fake words of consideration.

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:55.800
Where were you?

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:58.050
I will inform you of the details later.

00:17:58.050 --> 00:18:01.390
Oh yes, I have a gift for Kanna-sama.

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:05.640
A walnut? That's rare this time of year.

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:09.730
I hear it came from a branch that bore fruit early near a certain shrine, and is considered auspicious.

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:13.270
It is one of Kanna-sama's favourite foods, and is very nutritious.

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:17.700
I had a lot of things happen over here while you were gone.

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:21.780
Oh my, Kanna-sama!

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:24.040
Stop!

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:29.040
Don't tell me you left without saying anything so you could leave Kanna with me.

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:33.250
Only you, Ryuuya-sama, would think of something so disrespectful.

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:43.890
Why won't it crack?!

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:46.140
Stop it. You'll chip a tooth.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.140
Let me do something, too.

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:51.850
I don't want you two to do all the work.

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:55.820
Then go get some firewood.

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:58.780
And leave your walnut behind. I'll crack it for you.

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:00.860
Thank you.

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:04.080
Then I'm off to gather firewood!

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:04.910
Yeah.

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:08.040
Don't go too far.

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:09.750
I know.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:16.460
There was a checkpoint down the path from the market.

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:20.340
They were stopping young girls and checking their bare backs.

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:23.260
They must be checking for wings.

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:26.850
Looks like we can't take the main road anymore.

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:28.980
I'm surprised you found out.

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:33.650
That was an inconvenient place to hold a market.

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:37.020
I found it suspicious, so I investigated to be safe.

00:19:37.020 --> 00:19:39.030
You really are experienced with the ways of the world.

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:39.990
It was a big help.

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:46.620
Where did you learn such skills?

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:48.950
This is nothing but a circus act.

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:52.120
But still, I have to keep my skills honed.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:57.090
And don't tell Kanna. I don't want her to give me hell about how walnuts are alive, too.

00:19:57.420 --> 00:20:01.550
"You are forbidden to commit murder," was it?

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:05.510
Do you really think I'll keep that vow?

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:11.520
Kanna-sama did not want me to tell you, but...

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:15.270
...do you remember the night we fled from the shrine?

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:22.320
After that, she heard the voices of pursuers.

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:26.820
Ryuuya-dono is being chased.

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:28.780
I must go!

00:20:28.780 --> 00:20:31.660
He'll be killed if I don't!

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:36.080
If he dies, I... I...

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:41.380
She would not listen to me, even when I told her it was part of your stratagem.

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:44.380
Is that so?

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:49.560
Excuse me, but I believe you will keep your vow to not kill.

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:51.020
What makes you think that?

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:58.020
At that time, what would you have done if Kanna-sama told you to kill that soldier?

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:02.940
I would have got mad at her. I would have told her not to take a human life for granted.

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:07.570
Adults have to set an example for children.

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:09.780
That is correct.

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:14.460
I got it!

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:15.710
Is this enough?!

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:18.080
Kanna-sama!

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:20.920
I told you to be careful!

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:24.510
Shut up! I just couldn't see in front of me.

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:43.110
Ryuuya-dono...

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:45.860
Ryuuya-dono...

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:51.780
Ryuuya-dono...

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:53.240
What?

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:58.670
I want to ask a favour of you...

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:04.800
It's still a little embarrassing, but...

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:06.260
...will you watch me?

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:27.400
Trying to catch the white fragments of his dream,

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:33.200
a boy runs.

00:22:33.200 --> 00:22:37.040
When he lets go,

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:47.920
it disappears into the sound of the wind in the distance.

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:56.020
The kindness that he once saw is now gone.

00:22:56.020 --> 00:23:06.940
He steps forward alone, looking only at his feet.

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:22.330
He always listened to the song that disappeared by morning.

00:23:22.330 --> 00:23:37.600
He chased forever those footprints we left.

00:23:52.320 --> 00:23:54.280
I never saw my parents' faces.

00:23:56.240 --> 00:23:57.450
Why is that?

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:01.410
I was probably abandoned.

00:24:01.410 --> 00:24:05.420
Unsui took me in when he found me crying at the side of the road.
